- row  `Des`, `Rc2[40 | 64 | 128]`, `Blowfish[128 | 256 | 448]`  encrypt, decrypt  `permitDisallowedCrypto`
- row  `AesGcm[128 | 256]`, `ChaCha20Poly1305`  seal, unseal
